{"id":"n60808-1-7","stage":5,"title":"빠듯하다 · 紧凑","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60808-1-7-1","ko":"승규야, 방학 중 일과는 다 짰어?","zh":"承奎，假期的日程都安排好了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"방학","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중","meaning":"的时候","explanation":"중：的时候","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"2","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일과는","meaning":"日程，工作","explanation":"일과：日程，工作；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"일과","audio":"/audio/41577f4d50cc707e1242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72285","senseId":"1","lemma":"일과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짰어?","meaning":"安排","explanation":"짜다：安排；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"짜다","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37053","senseId":"4","lemma":"짜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"的时候","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"在做某事的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"41577f4d50cc707e","term":"일과","zh":"日程，工作","audio":"/audio/41577f4d50cc707e1242.mp3","entryId":"72285","definition":"定下来的每天要做的事。","pronunciation":["일과"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"2a62c1820e5f4c49","term":"짜다","zh":"安排","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3","entryId":"37053","definition":"定计划或定日程。","pronunciation":["짜다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d947fefaf5677ca369e0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60808-1-7-2","ko":"응. 근데 너무 빠듯하게 짠 것 같아.","zh":"嗯。不过感觉排得太满了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"근데","meaning":"可是，可","explanation":"근데：可是，可","readings":[{"term":"근데","audio":"/audio/9429d8c1a056112b539d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36013","senseId":"2","lemma":"근데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠듯하게","meaning":"紧凑，紧","explanation":"빠듯하다：紧凑，紧；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"빠듯하다","audio":"/audio/4d094a902f14ff6da7fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60808","senseId":"1","lemma":"빠듯하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짠","meaning":"安排","explanation":"짜다：安排；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"짜다","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37053","senseId":"4","lemma":"짜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"9429d8c1a056112b","term":"근데","zh":"可是，可","audio":"/audio/9429d8c1a056112b539d.mp3","entryId":"36013","definition":"用于将话题与前面内容相连接的同时，又将话头转向其他方向。","pronunciation":["근데"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"4d094a902f14ff6d","term":"빠듯하다","zh":"紧凑，紧","audio":"/audio/4d094a902f14ff6da7fb.mp3","entryId":"60808","definition":"财物或力量等勉强够用于做某事而不宽裕。","pronunciation":["빠드타다"]},{"id":"2a62c1820e5f4c49","term":"짜다","zh":"安排","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3","entryId":"37053","definition":"定计划或定日程。","pronunciation":["짜다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ae3379bc3baeed5aa94.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.316,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60808","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0413,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。不过感觉排得太满了。","承奎，假期的日程都安排好了吗？","今天风没怎么大啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎，假期的日程都安排好了吗？","今天风没怎么大啊。","嗯。不过感觉排得太满了。"],"answer":2}]}
